🎮 **An Educational Terminal Adventure Awaits You!**

You have entered an ancient digital realm where mysterious chambers hold the
secrets of terminal mastery. This is not just a game—it's a quest to unlock
the power of the POSIX command line (Linux, BSD, UNIX systems).

🗡️ **Your First Sacred Command**

Every great adventure begins with a single step. Your destiny starts here:

    cat scroll

📜 Type this command exactly as shown above, then press **RETURN** to begin.

🎯 **What You'll Learn**
• Navigate mysterious chambers using terminal commands
• Discover hidden treasures that represent real development skills  
• Master file operations, permissions, and shell scripting
• Build confidence with hands-on terminal practice

🧙‍♂️ **Guidance for New Adventurers**
• Read each `scroll` carefully—they contain valuable wisdom
• Explore thoroughly using `ls` to see what's around you
• Use `cat` to examine files and `cd` to move between chambers
• Your inventory (`echo $I`) tracks your progress and unlocks new areas

🌟 **The Journey Ahead**
Each chamber teaches specific terminal concepts through interactive encounters.
Progress naturally from basic navigation to advanced shell scripting skills.
Every command you learn here translates directly to real-world development.

